eve that every fan deserves merch that feels authentic, unique, and meaningful.<\\/p>\",\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"wd_text_block\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"0af7438\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6d93260\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"<p>We\\u2019re proud to be your go-to destination for gamer merch, and we\\u2019re excited to keep growing, innovating, and leveling up with you on this journey. Whether you\\u2019re here for a collectible that completes your setup or an apparel piece that speaks to your inner gamer, we\\u2019re here to make sure you find exactly what you\\u2019re looking for. Happy gaming!<\\/p>\",\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"wd_text_block\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"e42ddb9\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"90\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"70\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"50\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"scroll_y\":-80},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b3df77f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"content_repeater\":[{\"title\":\"Apparel & Accessories\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"_id\":\"6cc0d87\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"\",\"is_external\":false,\"nofollow\":false,\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"icon_type\":\"icon\",\"icon_text\":\"01.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/gms-inbx-gamepad-opt.jpg\",\"id\":\"1549\",\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"content\":\"<p>Show off your favorite gaming franchises in style, both in and out of the game<\\/p>\",\"btn_text\":\"\"},{\"title\":\"Collectibles & Decor\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"\",\"is_external\":false,\"nofollow\":false,\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"icon_type\":\"icon\",\"icon_text\":\"01.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/gms-inbx-puzzle-opt.jpg\",\"id\":\"1551\",\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"content\":\"<p>Bring your favorite game worlds to life with high-quality collectibles and home decor<\\/p>\",\"btn_text\":\"\",\"_id\":\"98b7ffc\"},{\"title\":\"Posters & Art Prints\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"\",\"is_external\":false,\"nofollow\":false,\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"icon_type\":\"icon\",\"icon_text\":\"01.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/gms-inbx-art-opt.jpg\",\"id\":\"1548\",\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"content\":\"<p>Decorate your walls with posters and art prints featuring iconic characters<\\/p>\",\"btn_text\":\"\",\"_id\":\"bdbea91\"},{\"title\":\"Unique Gifts & Bundles\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"link\":{\"url\":\"\",\"is_external\":false,\"nofollow\":false,\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"icon_type\":\"icon\",\"icon_text\":\"01.\",\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/gms-inbx-gift-opt.jpg\",\"id\":\"1550\",\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"content\":\"<p>Find the perfect gift for gamers with our exclusive bundles and unique merch<\\/p>\",\"btn_text\":\"\",\"_id\":\"fa746db\"}],\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"30\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":true},\"box_bg_color\":\"#F5F5F5\",\"slides_per_view\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]},\"slides_per_view_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]},\"hide_scrollbar_tablet\":\"\",\"hide_scrollbar_mobile\":\"\",\"sync_parent_id\":\"wd_69383e2a2ee2a\",\"content_t