ent/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-1-opt-300x300.jpg 300w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-1-opt-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 316px) 100vw, 316px\" />					\n								<img width=\"316\" height=\"380\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-2-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-2-opt.jpg 316w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-2-opt-249x300.jpg 249w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-2-opt-150x180.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 316px) 100vw, 316px\" />					\n								<img width=\"316\" height=\"284\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-3-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-3-opt.jpg 316w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-3-opt-300x270.jpg 300w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-3-opt-150x135.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 316px) 100vw, 316px\" />					\n								<img width=\"316\" height=\"348\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-4-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-4-opt.jpg 316w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-4-opt-272x300.jpg 272w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-img-4-opt-150x165.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 316px) 100vw, 316px\" />					\n								<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-section-title-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/el-section-title.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 					\n				<h4>Born from a Passion for Gaming</h4> \n								<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-text-block-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/el-text-block.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 					\n			<p>At [Merchandise], we’re more than just a store—we’re gamers like you, driven by a shared passion for the world of video games. Our journey began with a simple yet powerful idea: to create a place where gamers can find high-quality, officially licensed merchandise that truly reflects their love for gaming. Whether you’re reliving the nostalgia of retro classics or immersing yourself in the worlds of the latest blockbusters, we believe that every fan deserves merch that feels authentic, unique, and meaningful.</p>\n			<p>We’re proud to be your go-to destination for gamer merch, and we’re excited to keep growing, innovating, and leveling up with you on this journey. Whether you’re here for a collectible that completes your setup or an apparel piece that speaks to your inner gamer, we’re here to make sure you find exactly what you’re looking for. Happy gaming!</p>\n								<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-swiper-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/lib-swiper.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 					\n																							<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-info-box-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/el-info-box.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 					\n															<img width=\"68\" height=\"68\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-inbx-gamepad-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n											<h4						class=\"info-box-title title box-title-style-default wd-fontsize-m\" data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\">\n								Apparel & Accessories						</h4>\n					<p>Show off your favorite gaming franchises in style, both in and out of the game</p>\n															<img width=\"68\" height=\"68\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-inbx-puzzle-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n											<h4						class=\"info-box-title title box-title-style-default wd-fontsize-m\" data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\">\n								Collectibles & Decor						</h4>\n					<p>Bring your favorite game worlds to life with high-quality collectibles and home decor</p>\n															<img width=\"68\" height=\"68\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-inbx-art-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n											<h4						class=\"info-box-title title box-title-style-default wd-fontsize-m\" data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\">\n								Posters & Art Prints						</h4>\n					<p>Decorate your walls with posters and art prints featuring iconic characters</p>\n															<img width=\"68\" height=\"68\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/gms-inbx-gift-opt.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n											<h4						class=\"info-box-title title box-title-style-default wd-fontsize-m\" data-elementor-setting-key=\"title\">\n								Unique Gifts & Bundles						</h4>\n					<p>Find the perfect gift for gamers with our exclusive bundles and unique merch</p>\n												<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-swiper-arrows-critical-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/lib-swiper-arrows-critical.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 					\n						<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-swiper-pagin-critical-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/lib-swiper-pagin-critical.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 					\n			<ul></ul>\n								<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-swiper-scrollbar-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/lib-swiper-scrollbar.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 					\n								<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-accordion-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/el-accordion.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 						<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-accordion-elem-wpb-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/wp-content/themes/woodmart/css/parts/el-accordion-wpb-elem.css?ver=8.5.0\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" /> 			\n								What types of products do you offer?							\n							<p>Keep the product in its original packaging along with all documents confirming the purchase and refund. You will need this for further communication with the seller and the payment system.</p>\n								Do you sell officially licensed merchandise?							\n							<p>Check the email you received after placing your order. It should contain information about the status of your order and the expected delivery date.</p>\n								How long does shipping take?							\n							<p>Keep the product in its original packaging along with all documents confirming the purchase and refund. You will need this for further communication with the seller and the payment system.</p>\n								What is your return policy?							\n							<p>If the contents of the parcel are suspicious to customs officers (for example, many identical goods), it may be further checked.</p>\n								Do you offer discounts or special deals?							\n							<p>Keep the product in its original packaging along with all documents confirming the purchase and refund. You will need this for further communication with the seller and the payment system.</p>','About us','','publish','closed','closed','','about-us','','','2025-12-08 15:07:11','2025-12-08 15:07:11','',0,'https://dummy.xtemos.com/woodmart2/merchandise-elementor/?page_id=1058',0,'page','',0),(1060,1,'2025-12-08 15:07:21','2025-12-08 15:07:21','<link rel=\"stylesheet\" id=\"wd-section-title-css\" href=\"https://dummy.xtemos.com/w